{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the early 2000s, a computer engineer is sent to a remote mountain village to fix technical problems plaguing local businesses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But strange symbols and unsettling videos begin appearing on computers, followed by sudden disappearances of villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a routine assignment unravels into a nightmare as you explore an eerie rural village, interact with corrupted computers, and solve time-based visual puzzles that blend the boundary between cyberspace and the supernatural.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person exploration focused on atmosphere and slow-burn tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings shaped by your puzzle performance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-based, visual puzzles accessed via in-game computers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tightly paced psychological horror experience</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3132340?t=1759527789","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132340/a5a364a143bba9d3498967e5adaef0ea3a0c2322/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759527789","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132340/8f9eb8c661d40519c0a0b78e7bd24f57273cd155/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759527789","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132340/8f9eb8c661d40519c0a0b78e7bd24f57273cd155/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759527789","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Depictions of mild physical violence. Brief mention of self-harm. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_p